build: 2026-07-01 v10.78.2 (DAW reorg — transport bar · Bio page · Browser · coherence)
branch: claude/piano-roll-clip-view-wozlie (deployed via deploy branch)
notesT: The DAW-look reorg lands in force. The bottom bar now reads Arrange · Clips ·
  Compose · Mix · Bio · Browse — a familiar pro-tool layout where biofeedback is one
  source among many, not the whole app.
  NEW in this build:
  1) PERSISTENT TRANSPORT BAR — Play/Stop, the Tempo field, and a moving bars.beats
     position sit at the top of EVERY page (Ableton/Logic style), always one tap away.
  2) "Bio" PAGE — biofeedback's own home as a SOURCE: arm your body as an input, watch
     the live HR/HRV/breath/coherence, choose what it drives (sound timbre, the immersive
     visual) and set up brainwave entrainment (with the full safety notice).
  3) "Browse" PAGE — recall synth SOUNDS (presets, favorites-first, one-tap Load) and
     audition SAMPLES before you use them — the DAW left-column staple.
  4) TIDY-UP — the Channel Rack is the "Mix" page now, so its old duplicate Tools entry
     is gone (one thing, one home; also trims the Compose screen's view complexity).
  Everything from 10.77.5 stands (Mix page, smoothed visual pulse, entrainment audio+
  visual, Oscilloscope/Fractal/Aurora/Lissajous/Depth looks, route hardening).
  Test 10.78.0:
   • transport bar visible on every tab — Play starts the beat, position counts, Tempo
     drags/types;
   • Bio tab → Arm bio input, cover the camera+flash, numbers go live, toggle Body→sound
     and an entrainment band;
   • Browse tab → Presets: Load a sound then play and hear it; Samples: tap ▶ to preview;
   • switch tabs freely while a pulse reads — confirm no menu freeze anywhere;
   • transport Stop stays stopped during a bio Compose session (no auto-restart
     seconds later).
  Fixes in .1/.2 — the persistent transport bar is now fully coherent with every page:
   • Stop stays stopped during a live bio Compose session (the gentle auto-evolution
     no longer restarts playback ~30 s after you pressed Stop);
   • Stop from the transport bar also resets the Arrange page's song (no stuck
     "playing" state / lit playhead when you stop from the top bar);
   • changing Tempo from the transport bar keeps the metronome click in time.
